# A loft set square to its profiles (roadmap 28.3): path_loft's loft, its
# screen showing how it leaves the first profile and reaches the last,
# both set; then the solid checked.
file $testdata/ui/loft_profiles.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view default
move 300 400
down L 300 400
up L 300 400
menu Features|Loft To Selected Profile
tw
twmove 236 185
twdown L 236 185
twup L 236 185
edit 1
twmove 236 205
twdown L 236 205
twup L 236 205
edit 0.5
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
dump
